{
  "name": "Day 13 — Payment Webhook → GST Invoice → Email + Finance Sheet",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Day 13: Payment Webhook → GST Invoice → Email + Finance Sheet\n\n\n**Setup:**\n- Connect: Gmail (Google OAuth)\n- Connect: Google Sheets (Google OAuth)\n- Razorpay Dashboard → Settings → Webhooks → URL = production webhook URL, event = payment.captured\n- Production mein webhook signature (X-Razorpay-Signature) verify karna mat bhoolna\n- \"Payments\" tab headers: payment_id, email, phone, total, taxable, gst, invoice_no, date\n\nCourse: Day 13 lesson page",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "a5833e61-e818-4862-ac42-ce98955465f4",
      "name": "Setup Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        -160
      ]
    },
